WEBVTT

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.130
We're searching for
the Extra Seven.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.200
Hey, Shu.

00:02:02.366 --> 00:02:04.396
To be strong...

00:02:05.666 --> 00:02:08.026
He sure says it casually...

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:11.070
Telling me to find the Extra Seven.

00:02:21.966 --> 00:02:26.866
THE MYSTERY OF THE RUINS

00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:37.266
Hello.

00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:39.403
Homeron...

00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:41.496
About the matter we discussed...

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.270
R-Right... About that...

00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:48.966
You were right.
I was able to corroborate.

00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:52.573
But this case is really hairy.

00:02:53.166 --> 00:02:56.526
When people found out that
the Extra Seven had been stolen,

00:02:56.566 --> 00:03:00.296
a huge number of master informants
took action, it seems.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.770
I smell money for sure...

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.930
But it seems most of them
have already backed out.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.870
You know why, right?

00:03:09.533 --> 00:03:10.973
How many have disappeared?

00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:14.396
At least seven that
we could confirm.

00:03:15.233 --> 00:03:18.403
That means there's a guardian
interfering with this case.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.800
Thank you.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.130
Be careful.

00:03:25.266 --> 00:03:27.296
Who do you think I am?

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.330
I-I'm sorry...!

00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:44.766
Is this everyone?

00:03:45.066 --> 00:03:45.726
Yes.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:51.000
Of the eight, three came back alive.
That's awful.

00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:56.233
The Extra Seven was stolen
from the Jibral National Library

00:03:56.266 --> 00:03:58.366
by a Grankingdom spy.

00:03:58.866 --> 00:04:02.326
However, the spy was
eliminated soon after.

00:04:03.166 --> 00:04:06.366
Well, that's quite
some information though.

00:04:07.666 --> 00:04:08.826
So, any luck?

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:10.166
Not much...

00:04:10.233 --> 00:04:12.103
Too much time has passed and

00:04:12.133 --> 00:04:14.403
most of the informants
have backed out.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.200
Jibral doesn't even exist now,

00:04:16.233 --> 00:04:18.503
so there's no trail for us
to follow anymore.

00:04:18.666 --> 00:04:20.566
Somebody is putting pressure
on this case

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:23.130
and is interfering with
the investigation.

00:04:23.533 --> 00:04:25.633
There may not be
anyone out there

00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:27.996
with information about where
the Extra Seven is.

00:04:29.266 --> 00:04:31.226
Other than the one
who stole it, right?

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.430
Good work. You can all go.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.800
What about you?

00:04:36.966 --> 00:04:38.726
The initial investigation's done.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:41.000
I'll handle the rest of this
on my own.

00:04:47.433 --> 00:04:48.433
There it is!

00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:57.403
Those ruins are...?

00:04:57.433 --> 00:05:00.533
That's right. Those are
the Ruins of the Phoenix.

00:05:07.433 --> 00:05:08.733
This is my...

00:05:09.166 --> 00:05:11.466
Never knew there were
ruins here...

00:05:11.866 --> 00:05:15.596
Long ago, there was a historical city
called Luminas near here.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.230
It's an old city.

00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:19.033
There are passages about it
in the Book of the Beginning.

00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:22.026
But the city was abandoned after
their water supply dried up.

00:05:23.266 --> 00:05:23.926
Kluke...

00:05:24.666 --> 00:05:27.296
Perhaps your parents were
from Luminas?

00:05:28.066 --> 00:05:28.726
What?

00:05:28.766 --> 00:05:30.126
How did you know?!

00:05:30.433 --> 00:05:33.973
And you were born on
the same day as Shu. Right?

00:05:34.366 --> 00:05:37.266
We didn't tell you that...

00:05:37.766 --> 00:05:39.196
There's a reason, right?

00:05:39.933 --> 00:05:42.273
Let's just say "the Eclipse."

00:05:44.133 --> 00:05:45.933
Let's go! Let's take a look inside.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.930
There are stairs ahead...
Be careful, everyone.

00:06:14.866 --> 00:06:15.526
Maro!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.700
Hey! Don't scare me!

00:06:18.733 --> 00:06:20.003
Look at that, maro!

00:06:20.066 --> 00:06:20.726
Huh?

00:06:23.533 --> 00:06:24.633
This is...

00:06:24.733 --> 00:06:26.033
The Book of the Beginning...?

00:06:26.066 --> 00:06:30.066
Yes. It depicts the birth of
Shadows in this world.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.330
A secret door!

00:06:45.366 --> 00:06:46.366
Maro!

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.670
It's a door that only opens in
response to Shadow powers.

00:06:50.266 --> 00:06:53.826
People without the powers
can't open it.

00:07:09.033 --> 00:07:10.033
The Phoenix!

00:07:27.566 --> 00:07:30.566
I thought it was about time
you'd show up, Homeron.

00:07:31.133 --> 00:07:33.333
It's been a long time, Elder.

00:07:33.966 --> 00:07:35.966
I heard you'd made
a clean break from this world,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.830
but it seems you've come back.

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:42.033
I simply found a prize worth
returning for.

00:07:42.466 --> 00:07:44.366
The Extra Seven...?

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.030
You already know...

00:07:46.233 --> 00:07:49.233
Don't underestimate
my information network.

00:07:49.766 --> 00:07:52.326
Surely you haven't forgotten

00:07:52.366 --> 00:07:56.426
that nothing here occurs
without my knowledge.

00:07:57.466 --> 00:08:00.896
No, of course not.
That's why I've come here.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:04.270
Could I please see the list
of the people

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.870
who've entered and exited this city
over the past several days?

00:08:10.133 --> 00:08:10.803
It's okay.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.130
Now tell me why.

00:08:19.566 --> 00:08:21.866
Several days ago,
I decided to accept

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:24.600
a commission to look
for the Extra Seven.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.300
And already five of my men
have disappeared.

00:08:29.033 --> 00:08:32.633
In other words, someone knew about
my commission the moment I accepted it.

00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:34.773
A guardian, huh?

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.570
There's a woman behind this case.

00:08:38.066 --> 00:08:41.226
First, I want to look into the identity
of that woman.

00:08:41.966 --> 00:08:45.766
The woman entered this city
around the time my clients did.

00:08:46.466 --> 00:08:51.796
I need to know about that woman
in order to protect myself.

00:08:52.033 --> 00:08:53.433
Any leads?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.970
For starters, I'll check
the information on the list.

00:08:57.433 --> 00:08:58.433
Very well.

00:09:11.033 --> 00:09:11.703
Excuse me...

00:09:12.966 --> 00:09:15.296
I've been wondering for a while...

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:16.670
What is it?

00:09:17.133 --> 00:09:19.933
I was wondering if the reason
why you brought me along

00:09:19.966 --> 00:09:22.896
was because you knew
I had power...

00:09:23.966 --> 00:09:26.996
Everyone has the potential
to activate power.

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:30.133
But until I saw your Shadow,

00:09:30.166 --> 00:09:34.096
I never imagined that you were
a descendant of the Soldiers of Light.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:35.870
Oh, I see.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.200
You seemed to be
around Shu's age,

00:09:38.233 --> 00:09:40.503
so I thought there was a possibility.

00:09:41.466 --> 00:09:42.826
You mean that thing from before...

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:43.870
Yes.

00:09:44.233 --> 00:09:46.473
Shadow powers are passed down
each generation.

00:09:47.133 --> 00:09:49.103
We're not entirely sure about this,

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.870
but it's thought that the most powerful
Shadow manifestations appear

00:09:51.866 --> 00:09:54.526
in people who are born on the day
of a full solar eclipse,

00:09:54.566 --> 00:09:56.426
when there's least amount
of light.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.930
By the way, do you feel anything?

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:01.570
Huh?

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.530
These are the ruins of
your Shadow.

00:10:03.966 --> 00:10:06.496
I thought they might trigger
something for you...

00:10:07.233 --> 00:10:08.233
No...

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:24.500
Impossible... My Shadow appeared
only once.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.270
I tried to make it appear again,

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.330
but it doesn't even seem like
it's gonna happen.

00:10:29.433 --> 00:10:31.733
Well, I'm not saying you
should force it.

00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:36.096
But I'm not saying you should
just give up, either.

00:10:36.633 --> 00:10:40.333
You might learn something just
by walking around this place.

00:10:41.366 --> 00:10:42.026
Right!

00:11:08.733 --> 00:11:09.733
Kluke!

00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:19.433
I knew it...

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.100
It seems you found her.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:23.270
Yes.

00:11:23.566 --> 00:11:28.996
A woman probably in her early 20s
with blue eyes and long hair.

00:11:29.633 --> 00:11:34.173
She entered this city just after
Shu and the others did.

00:11:34.733 --> 00:11:35.403
And...

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.500
It seems there is no record
of her leaving this city.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:42.630
In other words, she's still nearby?

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.570
I must keep my guard up.

00:11:45.866 --> 00:11:47.166
But now I know for sure.

00:11:48.666 --> 00:11:52.326
This woman couldn't take
this much action alone.

00:11:53.466 --> 00:11:57.666
It's probably safe to assume that
she's working with someone big.

00:11:57.766 --> 00:12:00.866
What will you do?
If she's still in this city...

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:03.630
No, I'll do this alone.

00:12:04.066 --> 00:12:08.966
I accepted this case. I don't want to
cause trouble for you.

00:12:10.666 --> 00:12:11.666
Then...

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.200
Take this with you.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.070
What's this?

00:12:21.233 --> 00:12:22.933
It's yours to begin with.

00:12:22.966 --> 00:12:24.526
It will probably be of
some use to you.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.470
Thank you.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.170
Kluke!

00:12:29.333 --> 00:12:30.803
Kluke!

00:12:31.566 --> 00:12:32.626
Calm down, Shu!

00:12:32.966 --> 00:12:35.796
What're you saying?!
Kluke's disappeared!

00:12:36.233 --> 00:12:37.873
These are her ruins...

00:12:38.033 --> 00:12:38.703
But...

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:41.330
Let's wait. And believe in Kluke.

00:12:55.933 --> 00:12:56.933
The Phoenix...

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.970
You answered me that time...

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.330
Please... Once again...

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:34.900
Where am I?

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:43.270
We meet again, Kluke...

00:13:43.733 --> 00:13:44.733
Phoenix...

00:13:56.266 --> 00:13:57.366
Phoenix...

00:14:00.433 --> 00:14:02.703
We're in your ruins now.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:06.500
How can I summon your power?

00:14:07.033 --> 00:14:08.973
I do not know, either.

00:14:09.033 --> 00:14:12.673
But I feel nostalgic here
for some reason...

00:14:12.966 --> 00:14:14.896
What should I do?

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.670
I was able to help everyone
at that time,

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.570
but how can I summon you again?

00:14:19.933 --> 00:14:21.833
You should not be seeking power.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:22.770
What?

00:14:23.133 --> 00:14:26.473
The thing you are after is not power.

00:14:27.166 --> 00:14:28.496
Then what?

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.100
The answer is inside you.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.170
Inside me?

00:14:53.566 --> 00:14:54.566
This must be...

00:14:59.466 --> 00:15:00.566
I'll try.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.070
W-What can I do for you, Homeron?!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.700
I'll have the usual.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:31.930
C-Coming up.

00:15:32.566 --> 00:15:35.126
I'm going to be gone for a while,
so I stopped by for a bit.

00:15:51.233 --> 00:15:52.233
Here you go...

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.300
What's wrong?

00:15:54.566 --> 00:15:56.096
You look pale.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.330
R-Really?!

00:15:58.433 --> 00:16:00.333
Maybe it's just my imagination.

00:16:09.733 --> 00:16:11.333
Oh, that's right...

00:16:12.133 --> 00:16:14.803
Tarchev was looking for you.

00:16:15.466 --> 00:16:16.126
Huh?

00:16:16.733 --> 00:16:18.303
Don't make me say it again.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.800
He said he wanted to talk
to you about brewing.

00:16:21.266 --> 00:16:22.796
You should go immediately.

00:16:27.833 --> 00:16:28.833
Go!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:29.900
Right!

00:16:43.733 --> 00:16:44.973
Don't bother...

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:49.570
Let's just keep it civil
and say hello for today.

00:16:49.733 --> 00:16:50.733
Say hello?!

00:16:50.966 --> 00:16:53.226
You probably want to kill me.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:58.870
But if you do that, even you won't
be able to get out of Korin safely.

00:16:59.333 --> 00:17:03.733
This city is under tighter control
than you think.

00:17:04.433 --> 00:17:06.933
Are you saying I can leave safely
if I don't kill you?

00:17:07.366 --> 00:17:10.866
I told you.
We'll just say hello for today.

00:17:11.966 --> 00:17:14.396
You sure say some elegant things.

00:17:14.633 --> 00:17:19.803
A man who lacks the grace and curiosity
isn't much of a master informant.

00:17:20.233 --> 00:17:21.673
Remember that.

00:17:21.866 --> 00:17:26.196
That's expected of the greatest
master informant in history... I guess.

00:17:30.366 --> 00:17:33.196
Smells good.
The fragrance of flowers...

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.800
Let's meet again...
whatever your name is...

00:17:42.233 --> 00:17:43.773
Homeron, the master informant...

00:17:46.033 --> 00:17:47.903
It looks like this will be entertaining.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:58.300
- Kluke! Kluke!
- Where are you!

00:17:58.366 --> 00:17:59.366
Kluke!

00:17:59.733 --> 00:18:00.873
- Shu!
- Kluke.

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:01.900
Kluke!

00:18:01.933 --> 00:18:03.173
I'm glad you're safe...

00:18:03.566 --> 00:18:06.796
I don't really know what happened,
but I found this.

00:18:07.866 --> 00:18:10.666
I don't know what that stone is,

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:13.370
but it seems to be something
very important for you.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:14.470
Yes!

00:18:14.866 --> 00:18:16.326
That's great, Kluke.

00:18:16.733 --> 00:18:17.403
Yeah.

00:18:22.433 --> 00:18:24.833
Retreat! We must survive,
no matter what!

00:18:24.866 --> 00:18:26.826
But there are too many enemies!

00:18:26.866 --> 00:18:29.666
Don't whine! Don't give up
until the very end!

00:18:41.566 --> 00:18:42.226
What's that?

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:44.000
The remains of the Jibral Army...?

00:18:44.466 --> 00:18:46.096
At this rate, they won't last long.

00:18:46.533 --> 00:18:48.273
Let's go help them
right away, maro!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.270
Zola!

00:18:50.633 --> 00:18:52.773
Even if I said no,
you wouldn't listen, right?

00:18:53.833 --> 00:18:55.073
We'll finish this in ten minutes.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.400
You can manage, right, Kluke?

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:01.570
Let's go!

00:19:02.566 --> 00:19:04.696
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:19:23.733 --> 00:19:25.333
You okay, guys?!

00:19:25.633 --> 00:19:27.273
We've come to help, maro!

00:19:27.333 --> 00:19:29.373
Hornet Pierce!

00:19:35.566 --> 00:19:38.096
- Oooooh!
- Awesome! Nice!

00:19:53.733 --> 00:19:55.503
This is a cinch, maro!

00:19:57.666 --> 00:19:58.326
Oh!

00:19:58.566 --> 00:19:59.566
What's that?!

00:20:06.666 --> 00:20:08.026
That thing's huge.

00:20:08.066 --> 00:20:10.266
To think they'd have an ace
in the hole like that!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.870
S-Something's glowing!
Isn't this bad?!

00:20:30.966 --> 00:20:31.626
Kluke!

00:20:44.266 --> 00:20:47.096
Calm down. You can do it!

00:20:47.733 --> 00:20:48.403
Right!

00:20:49.666 --> 00:20:51.496
It's not power that I seek...

00:20:52.133 --> 00:20:54.633
What I seek... That is...!

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:01.200
Our power is to protect everyone!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.470
Shu! Now!

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:17.470
Got it!

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:20.170
Fire Crisis!

00:21:36.633 --> 00:21:37.633
I did it...

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.270
- Kluke!
- Kluke!

00:21:41.266 --> 00:21:42.796
Awesome, Kluke!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:43.570
Shu!

00:21:46.733 --> 00:21:47.803
Now then...

00:21:54.933 --> 00:21:56.033
Something wrong?

00:21:56.533 --> 00:21:57.533
You're going?

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:58.670
Yes.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:03.400
I see... Then I'll deliver the message
that the Elder has sent.

00:22:04.133 --> 00:22:07.303
It seems the woman you seek
is headed west.

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:10.530
So it seems.

00:22:18.333 --> 00:22:23.773
- Thanks!
- Goodbye!

00:22:27.266 --> 00:22:29.366
That pendant sure is lovely!

00:22:30.133 --> 00:22:32.003
Let me have it!

00:22:32.166 --> 00:22:34.026
What?! No way!

00:22:34.066 --> 00:22:35.326
Wait!

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:38.030
I'll lend you my Hippo for it!

00:22:38.066 --> 00:22:40.866
"Power to protect everyone," huh?

00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:24.100
Shu and the others work out
a plan to rescue Conrad

00:24:24.133 --> 00:24:25.973
and simulate it with
a collective effort.

00:24:26.033 --> 00:24:27.633
I'll save Conrad.

00:24:28.266 --> 00:24:30.366
Too bad! It's back to
square one, maro.

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:31.970
You got too greedy.

00:24:32.433 --> 00:24:35.633
Awesome, maro.
A special lesson from Cynthia, maro.

00:24:35.666 --> 00:24:37.426
Why is it always me?

00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:40.200
Next on Blue Dragon:
"The Captive Knight"
